<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Terexko cautions on sub judice matters.</title>
<headline>Terexko cautions on sub judice matters.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conference to hotels company Terexko Ltd said on Monday it was considering certain sub judice matters which could have an impact on the company's share price.</p>
<p>The company said in a cautionary announcement that shareholders should exercise caution in their share dealings until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482-1003</p>
</text>
